    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see what you're saying about the \"proof-of-concept\" angle, but I'm a bit nervous. If they see $n=12$ on a paper aiming for this level of impact, aren't they just going to dismiss the statistical significance entirely? I don't want to spend six months on this only to have them reject it in the first round because the methodology looks thin.",
